/fr/a-propos/presse  /fr/presse-medias/presse/           301
/nl/over/pers/       /nl/pers-media/pers/                301
/nl/over/pers        /nl/pers-media/pers/                301
/en/about/images/    /en/press-media/photos-videos/      301
/en/about/images     /en/press-media/photos-videos/      301
